# Ad-hoc wire captures from paperd/extproc contain real user prompts and model
# responses. Drop them here to run the wire-capture tests against your own
# traffic locally; this directory is never committed.
#
# Committable recordings are a different thing. A recording may be committed
# only if it is fixture-grade: captured in a clean room, credential- and
# PII-free in headers *and* bodies, and reviewed. That bar, and the recordings
# meeting it, are governed by fixtures/manifest.json and policed by
# pkg/backfill/recordings_scrub_test.go.
extproc/testdata/wire-captures/
